  "id": "fig-11",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Draft only: inspect the downward-opening schematic entirely below the x-axis in the unchanged example y=-2x^2+x-5. Frozen current-template context: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/editions/modern-us-neutral/figures/evidence/fig-11/context.json; raw SHA-256 57d1dffd0f5cd9349c7468170dec4639660ea4ade996bae7d96793aa1a5d54bf. Not finalized edition text or new SOURCE/math approval. Coordinates are approximate inverted-y source-pixel layout only. Modern additions: clean semantic ink, explicit label anchors, straightened axes within the source stroke, finite piecewise-linear samples, and source-landmark anchors embedded in the existing strokes. No grid, ticks, guides, numeric y-intercept, vertex value, formula, solution annotation, independent point marker or boundary extension. HOLD: exact thick-stroke centerline, vertex and terminal coordinates are manual estimates; not rendered or visually approved. The n5 printed y=2x^4+4x-1 and p0027-math-1 blank correction remain unapproved and untouched.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/figures/fig-11.png",
      "sha256": "34e5979e7cbc4d82afd4227aac6667affe22a5cab62223c950a6b298084dc9f5"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "在图11中画出了函数$y=-2x^2+x-5$的简略的图象. 由图看出，对于所有的$x$值，三项式的值是负的. 因此，不等式$-2x^2+x-5>0$的解集合是空集."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "函数$y=-2x^2+x-5$的图象是“开口”向下的抛物线."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "三项式$-2x^2+x-5$的判别式是负数（$D=1-40<0$）. 就是说，抛物线和$x$轴没有公共点."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "图11"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "解二次不等式时，我们利用了关于二次函数的图象相对于$x$轴的位置的想法. 显然，这个位置由两个条件确定，就是二次三项式$ax^2+bx+c$的系数$a$的符号和判别式$D$的值. 抛物线“开口”的方向决定于系数$a$的符号，抛物线相对于$x$轴的位置（抛物线和$x$轴有两个公共点，只有一个公共点，没有公共点）决定于判别式$D$的符号."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n6",
        "text": "函数$y=ax^2+bx+c(a\\ne0)$的图象相对于$x$轴的位置表示在图12中."
      }
    ],
